                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Man Matters' biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Adjacent male wellness positioning + consultation-first + Mensa Brands house-of-brands backing + sensitive category marketing discipline. Multi-dimensional advantage.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new male wellness brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific concern niching (hair loss specialty, performance specialty, mental health, senior male wellness). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>Is house-of-brands strategy sustainable?</h3>
                                        <p>Emerging pattern — Mensa + G.O.A.T Brands + others operating house-of-brands roll-ups. Different capital + operational model than legacy FMCG acquisition.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest male wellness lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Consultation + trust + sensitive marketing + regulatory discipline combined. Product-only + aspirational marketing insufficient for health-adjacent categories.</p>
